@startuml
left to right direction
actor "DMS Records/Registry Officer" as Records
rectangle "APGC DMS — records lifecycle" {
  usecase "Archive own finalized Memo\n[CURRENT: owner-only]" as OwnerArchive
  usecase "Register finalized record\n[FUTURE]" as Register
  usecase "Manage retention / archival queue\n[FUTURE]" as Retention
  usecase "Retrieve authorized record\n[FUTURE: explicit scope]" as Retrieve
  usecase "Disposition / transfer records\n[FUTURE: policy required]" as Disposition
}
Records --> OwnerArchive
Records ..> Register : target registry function
Records ..> Retention : target records function
Records ..> Retrieve : target records function
Records ..> Disposition : target records function
note bottom of OwnerArchive
  Archive currently requires document ownership and FINALIZED
  state. The Registry Officer group does not grant it.
  No retention schedule, registry, or disposal workflow exists.
end note
@enduml
